BType      "B engine"      0 7    0    enum Off Wavetable Analog Sample Granular Harmonic Modal Spectral | What slot B plays: a morphing wavetable, an analog wave, a sample, grains of a sample, additive partials, a struck, plucked or bowed resonating body, or the resynthesis of a sample from its analysed partials and noise (samples, grains, partials, bodies and resynthesis take no warps)
