    sound 100 % gives a natural, never-the-same start for each note; 0 % makes every note start identically and punchy.
BWarp1     "B warp 1"      0 11   0    enum None Bend+ Bend− Squeeze Mirror Asym Sync Window_sync FM PM AM Ring | First warp: how the cycle is read (FM, PM, AM and Ring take the modulator)
    how Chooses the first warp of slot B, a bend, squeeze, mirror, sync, FM, PM, AM or ring change to how the cycle is read.
