CType      "C engine"      0 7    0    enum Off Wavetable Analog Sample Granular Harmonic Modal Spectral | What slot C plays: a morphing wavetable, an analog wave, a sample, grains of a sample, additive partials, a struck, plucked or bowed resonating body, or the resynthesis of a sample from its analysed partials and noise (samples, grains, partials, bodies and resynthesis take no warps)
    how Chooses what slot C plays: off, a morphing wavetable, an analog wave, a sample, grains of a sample, additive partials, a resonating body or the resynthesis of a sample.
    sound Each engine has its own character, from bright and digital through warm and analog to glassy, airy, struck and woody, or a sample made to hold, stretch or change pitch.
